{"logId": "5abb87b2-d524-4431-b5a5-f030376af7c8", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "心，服务员真正成为顾客的贴心朋友。", "block_bbox": [239, 228, 563, 254], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 228.0], [563.0, 228.0], [563.0, 254.0], [239.0, 254.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "零售业（百货业）找准市场，准确定位发展和创新模式是成功的几个重要因素，而胖东来百货恰恰符合了这些要素。全新的超值服务、商品层次化经营——胖东来吸引着不管是农村消费者，还是城市的高档消费人群，以及个性化创新的消费人群。胖东来百货始终倡行的主体化经营，即主体服务，提高服务质量，也就是提高了商场产品的附加值，逐步形成良性循环的发展趋势。", "block_bbox": [238, 264, 1016, 429], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 429.0], [238.0, 429.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "如何树立好企业形象，以吸引更多的消费者光顾呢？梁益海教授说，胖东来百货凭借好的企业内部管理，在广大受众中间树立起良好的员工形象，产品形象和品牌形象，使全体员工有一种“忠于胖东来就是忠于顾客，忠于顾客就是忠于自己”的积极心理素质。", "block_bbox": [238, 438, 1016, 535], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 438.0], [1016.0, 438.0], [1016.0, 535.0], [238.0, 535.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 602, 225, 727], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[73.0, 602.0], [225.0, 602.0], [225.0, 727.0], [73.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“胖东来百货的这种零售业（百货业）模式应该在全市商场中推广。”对于胖东来百货今后怎样才能走得更远，梁益海教授的话语中肯，语气坚决：“加强员工的管理，但不是单纯‘管’员工，而是要通过培训提高员工的整体素质；在引进商品时，严把产品供应渠道，进货走规模化发展道路，发展多品种、小批、大量的经营模式。”", "block_bbox": [238, 542, 1017, 675], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 542.0], [1017.0, 542.0], [1017.0, 675.0], [238.0, 675.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [261, 753, 1000, 1156], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[261.0, 753.0], [1000.0, 753.0], [1000.0, 1156.0], [261.0, 1156.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "保安部员工表演的舞狮", "block_bbox": [288, 1177, 468, 1200], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[288.0, 1177.0], [468.0, 1177.0], [468.0, 1200.0], [288.0, 1200.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "胖东来如何打造快乐团队", "block_bbox": [112, 1406, 505, 1449], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 1406.0], [505.0, 1406.0], [505.0, 1449.0], [112.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8024923205375671, "coordinate": [239, 228, 563, 254], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 228.0], [563.0, 228.0], [563.0, 254.0], [239.0, 254.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9515752792358398, "coordinate": [238, 264, 1016, 429], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 264.0], [1016.0, 429.0], [238.0, 429.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9370065331459045, "coordinate": [238, 438, 1016, 535], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 438.0], [1016.0, 438.0], [1016.0, 535.0], [238.0, 535.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5227239727973938, "coordinate": [73, 602, 225, 727], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[73.0, 602.0], [225.0, 602.0], [225.0, 727.0], [73.0, 727.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.945402979850769, "coordinate": [238, 542, 1017, 675], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 542.0], [1017.0, 542.0], [1017.0, 675.0], [238.0, 675.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8687570691108704, "coordinate": [261, 753, 1000, 1156], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[261.0, 753.0], [1000.0, 753.0], [1000.0, 1156.0], [261.0, 1156.0]]}, {"cls_id": 7, "label": "figure_title", "score": 0.3492986857891083, "coordinate": [288, 1177, 468, 1200], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[288.0, 1177.0], [468.0, 1177.0], [468.0, 1200.0], [288.0, 1200.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5748826861381531, "coordinate": [112, 1406, 505, 1449], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[112.0, 1406.0], [505.0, 1406.0], [505.0, 1449.0], [112.0, 1449.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "心，服务员真正成为顾客的贴心朋友。\n\n零售业（百货业）找准市场，准确定位发展和创新模式是成功的几个重要因素，而胖东来百货恰恰符合了这些要素。全新的超值服务、商品层次化经营——胖东来吸引着不管是农村消费者，还是城市的高档消费人群，以及个性化创新的消费人群。胖东来百货始终倡行的主体化经营，即主体服务，提高服务质量，也就是提高了商场产品的附加值，逐步形成良性循环的发展趋势。\n\n如何树立好企业形象，以吸引更多的消费者光顾呢？梁益海教授说，胖东来百货凭借好的企业内部管理，在广大受众中间树立起良好的员工形象，产品形象和品牌形象，使全体员工有一种“忠于胖东来就是忠于顾客，忠于顾客就是忠于自己”的积极心理素质。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n“胖东来百货的这种零售业（百货业）模式应该在全市商场中推广。”对于胖东来百货今后怎样才能走得更远，梁益海教授的话语中肯，语气坚决：“加强员工的管理，但不是单纯‘管’员工，而是要通过培训提高员工的整体素质；在引进商品时，严把产品供应渠道，进货走规模化发展道路，发展多品种、小批、大量的经营模式。”\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_261_753_1000_1156.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"62%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">保安部员工表演的舞狮</div>\n\n\n## 胖东来如何打造快乐团队", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5abb87b2-d524-4431-b5a5-f030376af7c8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A51Z%2F-1%2F%2F6374e60a37084e100998334caef88d84f877379a765c75ab4fcbbee8b5f51aaa", "imgs/img_in_image_box_261_753_1000_1156.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5abb87b2-d524-4431-b5a5-f030376af7c8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_261_753_1000_1156.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A51Z%2